  "Interface weight": "界面字重",
  "Interface weight is everything outside the panels — menus, dialogs and this page. It moves the whole interface together, so text Material draws a step heavier stays a step heavier. The directory slider starts where the file slider is, so a folder cannot be set lighter than the files it sits among. Emphasis is free. The offset moves all four at once. A family that ships only Regular and Bold draws the nearest face it has, so several steps can look identical — the preview beside this is drawn at the weights set here, and this page is drawn at the interface one, which is where to see whether this font answers to them.": "界面字重作用于面板以外的所有内容——菜单、对话框以及本页。它让整个界面一起变化，因此 Material 本来就画得粗一级的文字仍然粗一级。文件夹滑块从文件滑块所在的位置开始，因此文件夹不能设得比与之并列的文件更细。强调字重不受限制。偏移会同时移动这四项。只提供 Regular 和 Bold 的字体系列会使用最接近的字形，因此几个级别看起来可能完全相同——旁边的预览按此处设置的字重绘制，而本页按界面字重绘制，要看此字体是否响应这些设置，就看本页。",
